{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let's start tiling!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Would it be possible to tile aperiodically with only one shape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This problem, called the Einstein Problem from the German \u201cein stein\u201d meaning one stone, was unsolved for many years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2022, David Smith finally discovered the einstein tile!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/24ffa23a64dce4a074b061a1acfc5892.avif?t=1752321282\" width=256 height=221 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is based on the einstein tile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The imagination is limitless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own original background image by laying einstein tiles as you wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/fd3d4691e0111e791349276850e9a537.poster.avif?t=1752321282\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/fd3d4691e0111e791349276850e9a537.webm?t=1752321282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/fd3d4691e0111e791349276850e9a537.mp4?t=1752321282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill the given frame with einstein tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a so-called jigsaw puzzle. There is no pattern, though.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/686924042a567f95b0e22ca57d1d3762.poster.avif?t=1752321282\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/686924042a567f95b0e22ca57d1d3762.webm?t=1752321282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/686924042a567f95b0e22ca57d1d3762.mp4?t=1752321282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Photo and Video Submission Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether for commercial or non-commercial purposes, you are free to use this game's footage in YouTube videos, live streams, or on websites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Puzzle Initiate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3550470/f3df0baf26a0db904228e144e4abb00c6865ee22.jpg"},{"name":"Spark of Curiosity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3550470/78eb0af682d5dca109f03665cacd091e06820b27.jpg"},{"name":"Clue Seeker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3550470/5cc741e9b25694b01933d15d9f0401e979e89242.jpg"},{"name":"Riddle Rookie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3550470/3951b4cdabfc0db963b335d6e76900acfed57228.jpg"},{"name":"Mind Awakening","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3550470/d8c1ee21f0f21575e42d35be0d58584fd4e34746.jpg"},{"name":"Puzzle Pioneer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3550470/e027a8f8aface18d82fe3bdddff5bfe9db295b75.jpg"},{"name":"Logic Learner","path